{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29081","headline":"十二月拜起居表回 · 许浑","name":"十二月拜起居表回","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一章西奏拜仙曹，回马天津北望劳。\n寒水欲春冰彩薄，晓山初霁雪峰高。\n楼形向日攒飞凤，宫势凌波压拚鳌。\n空锁烟霞绝巡幸，周人谁识郁金袍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29081.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29081","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}